  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-11\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 11</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <p>En ce qui concerne les infractions prévues à l'article 1er,</p>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">a, b, c, d, f et g</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">...</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">...</span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <p>l'amende administrative est appliquée autant de fois qu'il y a de personnes occupées en violation de ces dispositions, sans que son montant puisse excéder <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2009-06-17/01\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"66\">20 000 euros</span>.</p>\n          <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"1987-07-24/31\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"46\">&lt;L 1987-07-24/31, art. 46, 004; En vigueur : 30-08-1987&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"1988-12-30/31\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"90\">&lt;L 1988-12-30/31, art. 90, 005; En vigueur : 1989-01-01&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <p>(alinéa 2 abrogé)</p>\n          <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"1994-03-23/30\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"19\">&lt;L 1994-03-23/30, art. 19, 011; En vigueur : 01-04-1994&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <p>En ce qui concerne les infractions visées à l'article 1erbis,</p>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">...</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">...</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">b)</span>\n              <ol>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">...</li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">...</li>\n              </ol>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <p>l'amende administrative est multipliée par le nombre de personnes pour lesquelles les dispositions visées dans cet article ont été violées, sans que son montant puisse excéder <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2009-06-17/01\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"66\">100 000 euros</span>.</p>\n          <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"1994-03-23/30\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"19\">&lt;L 1994-03-23/30, art. 19, 011; En vigueur : 01-04-1994&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"1999-03-26/30\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"17\">&lt;L 1999-03-26/30, art. 17, 017; En vigueur : 01-01-1999&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
